# Coolbx OS — bureaublad-defaults (ontwerp "papier & inkt", ADR-0035): licht papier om op te
# werken; het kader (opstart, aanmelden, kiosk) is nacht. Eén accent: mint.
[org/gnome/desktop/interface]
color-scheme='default'
accent-color='green'
font-name='Inter 11'
document-font-name='Inter 11'
monospace-font-name='Source Code Pro 10'
clock-show-weekday=true

[org/gnome/desktop/background]
picture-uri='file:///usr/share/backgrounds/coolbx/coolbx-paper.png'
picture-uri-dark='file:///usr/share/backgrounds/coolbx/coolbx-paper.png'
picture-options='zoom'
primary-color='#faf8f3'
secondary-color='#faf8f3'

[org/gnome/desktop/screensaver]
picture-uri='file:///usr/share/backgrounds/coolbx/coolbx-night.png'
picture-options='zoom'
primary-color='#141210'

[org/gnome/desktop/wm/preferences]
button-layout='appmenu:minimize,maximize,close'

[org/gnome/shell]
enabled-extensions=['dash-to-dock@micxgx.gmail.com']

# Vaste dock onderaan, altijd zichtbaar, inkt-kleur — de "shelf" (ADR-0035).
[org/gnome/shell/extensions/dash-to-dock]
dock-position='BOTTOM'
dock-fixed=true
intellihide=false
autohide=false
extend-height=false
multi-monitor=true
dash-max-icon-size=40
show-trash=false
show-mounts=false
show-show-apps-button=true
show-apps-at-top=false
custom-background-color=true
background-color='#141210'
transparency-mode='FIXED'
background-opacity=0.92
apply-custom-theme=false
running-indicator-style='DOTS'
click-action='minimize-or-previews'
disable-overview-on-startup=true
